  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">First Step: Online Pre-departure Integration Measures (PDIMs) in Malta</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at preparing third country nationals interested in working in Malta for life through the provision of solid guidelines for the design of an online platform in which they can enroll to training courses as well as getting information on cultural orientation, covering social, cultural, economic, and historical aspects, rights and duties before entering Malta. It will equip the migrant population with information about labour and migration related laws, sociocultural norms and practices. The trainings and online tools will provide critical information about Malta and identify the skills and attitudes needed for migrants to successfully integrate.On the basis of this project, an online platform with a range of useful PDIMs will be designed in order to contribute to an optimized integration of migrants into the Maltese society. This platform will enable them to fully use their competencies and skills, become an asset to the country, as well as reducing the risk of labour exploitation, and to feel empowered in the workplace and the community.</narrative>
  </description>
